# Keep the build context source-only and reproducible: dependencies and build
# outputs are (re)generated inside the image, never copied from the host. Not
# excluding these lets stale local dist/ mask missing build steps (the API/web
# images compiled locally but failed in CI for exactly this reason).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.docusaurus
**/coverage

# Python worker virtualenv + caches (irrelevant to the JS images, very large).
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache

# VCS / local noise
.git
.gitlab-ci.yml
**/*.log
data
